# Keep KiCad project sources, libraries, and project configuration tracked:
# *.kicad_pro, *.kicad_sch, *.kicad_pcb, *.kicad_sym, *.kicad_mod,
# fp-lib-table, sym-lib-table, and custom design-rule files.
#
# Manufacturing outputs (Gerbers, drill, position, STEP, PDF, etc.) are not
# ignored here because projects often deliberately version release artifacts.
# Add a project-specific output directory (for example, /manufacturing/) if
# those files are always generated locally.
